NOTE:-
This is a sample log demonstrating the type of output that will be generated when the script is executed. 
The actual log will follow the same structure and format.

You may notice that metrics such as RAM, Load, Disk, and Temperature display values along with status indicators such as good, 
warn, high, or HOT. However, some servers may display N/A for these metrics.

This occurs when the command used to collect the additional system information — landscape-sysinfo — is not available on that particular server. 
In such cases, the script cannot retrieve those optional metrics and therefore records them as N/A.

